// A case's `then` clauses, dispatched by node kind: a check (check/), the
// output clauses (more/print/), or a call clause (more/calls/). The kind was
// decided when the case was parsed
// (front/.../case/then/more/dispatch.id), so this only routes. The loop over
// each clause lives in check_scopes (mid/names/symbols/build/scopes.id),
// which chains into it once its own block is full.

fit_then(int ti) {
  int chk_node = (import thennode)[ti];
  string kind = (import nkind)[chk_node];
  fit_then_kind(kind, chk_node);
} return void;
